# API Information


main: {
  kit: {
    info: {
      auth: false
      contact: {
        email: "info@theholisticcare.com"
        name: "The Holistic Care"
        url: "https://www.theholisticcare.com"
      }
      description: `A free, public, read-only REST API exposing The Holistic Care's open mindfulness resources — research citations (whitepapers), a plain-language glossary, free mindfulness games, free guided-audio practices, blog post excerpts, The Holistic Care Podcast episodes (English and Hindi), and the public PanchaVikas early-years framework — as structured JSON. No authentication required. A unified \`/v1/resources\` browse endpoint and a \`/v1/search\` endpoint aggregate across every family at once. Blog endpoints expose metadata/excerpts only — full article content remains on the canonical The Holistic Care website. See \`/docs\` for a fair-use/attribution note and a versioning policy alongside this reference.

Licensing note: this OpenAPI spec and the repository's code are MIT licensed (see the \`license\` field below and \`LICENSE\` in the repo). The *content* this API returns (research summaries, glossary entries, game descriptions, guided-practice metadata, blog excerpts, podcast episode summaries, PanchaVikas materials) is NOT covered by that MIT license — it remains Copyright © The Holistic Care, all rights reserved, unless a specific resource states otherwise. See \`LICENSING.md\` in the repository for the full breakdown of software license vs. API access terms vs. content rights vs. attribution.
`
      license: {
        name: "MIT (code only — see LICENSING.md for content rights)"
        url: "https://github.com/mohanagc/thc-open-mindfulness-api/blob/main/LICENSE"
      }
      servers: [
        {
          description: "Production (only environment currently deployed)"
          url: "https://api.theholisticcare.com"
        }
      ]
      summary: "A free, public, read-only REST API exposing The Holistic Care's open mindfulness resources — research citations (whitepapers), a plain-language glossary, free mindfulness games, free guided-audio practices, blog post excerpts, The…"
      title: "THC Open Mindfulness Resources API"
      version: "1.0.0"
      website: "https://theholisticcare.com"
    }
  }
}

